        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-500">4. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>This website and its content are provided on an "as is" basis. SBDMC, Inc. makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, regarding the operation of this website or the information, content, or materials included on this site.</p>

