        <p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of the Philippines. Any disputes relating to these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of the Philippines.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-500">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>SBDMC, Inc. Admin Office</strong><br />
          Argonaut Highway cor. Rizal Highway<br />
          Subic Bay Gateway Park, Subic Bay Freeport Zone 2222<br />
          Email: inquiry@sbdmc.com<br />
          Phone: (047) 252-3456
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
